{
  "description": "The memory helper's shared cases (design/45-Long-Term-Memory.md, \"The helper (PR 3)\"), replayed by rust/strata-ai/tests/memory_cases.rs and dotnet/tests/Datalium.Strata.Tests/AI/MemoryCaseTests.cs. Not a wire format: it pins the helper's labels, tenants, batching, failures and refusals across the two engines. Each case makes a fresh in-memory memory store of `dimensions` and a scripted embedder (provider `embedder.provider`, default model `embedder.model`) that answers each input with its vector in `embedder.vectors`, in order, reporting 4 input tokens per input, no output tokens, and model `embedder.model`. A call with an input in `embedder.fails` fails as a whole: an HTTP status answer with its `status`, `retry_after_ms` hint and `message` (Rust a `ChatError::status`; .NET an exception ModelFaults classifies the same way). An input in `embedder.unanswered` gets no vector (the answer has one vector fewer). The helper is made with `options` (`model`: the label; `tenant_key`; absent: the defaults). `context` null: every step is called without a node context; otherwise the steps run in order inside the one node `Memory` of a graph run with `context.metadata` as its run metadata and an observer. Steps: `remember` (an entry: `namespace`, `id`, `text`, `tenant` (absent: unset), `content` (an object), `metadata`), `remember_many` (entries), `recall` (`namespace`, `text`, `options`: `tenant` (absent: unset), `limit` (default 10), `min_similarity`, `exclude`, `metadata`; `expect` the matches in order as {id, similarity}, similarity compared to 1e-5), `get` (a key read from the store directly; `expect` the record's JSON form without schema_version and timestamps, or null). A step with `failure` must fail with a node failure of that kind, hint (`retry_after_ms`, absent: none) and message (Rust `MemoryError::Embedding`, .NET a NodeException); one with `error` must be refused with exactly that message before any embedding call (Rust `MemoryError::Store`, .NET an ArgumentException). `calls`: every embedding call's inputs, in order (absent: not checked). `events`: the run's model-call events in order as `ModelCallStarted <operation> <model> <provider>` and `ModelCallCompleted <operation> <Result> <input tokens, or - when none>` (absent: not checked).",
  "dimensions": 3,
  "embedder": {
    "provider": "scripted",
    "model": "embed-1",
    "vectors": {
      "disk full on db-1": [
        1,
        0,
        0
      ],
      "disk nearly full on db-2": [
        0.9,
        0.1,
        0
      ],
      "pod in a crash loop": [
        0,
        1,
        0
      ],
      "certificate expired": [
        0,
        0,
        1
      ],
      "the disk is full": [
        1,
        0.05,
        0
      ]
    },
    "fails": {
      "rate limited": {
        "status": 429,
        "retry_after_ms": 2000,
        "message": "slow down"
      }
    },
    "unanswered": [
      "never answered"
    ]
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "remember labels the vector <provider>/<model> and keeps the text; recall finds it",
      "context": {
        "metadata": {}
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "remember": {
            "namespace": "incidents",
            "id": "inc-1",
            "text": "disk full on db-1",
            "content": {
              "cause": "logs"
            },
            "metadata": {
              "service": "db"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remember": {
            "namespace": "incidents",
            "id": "inc-2",
            "text": "pod in a crash loop"
          }
        },
        {
          "get": {
            "namespace": "incidents",
            "tenant": "",
            "id": "inc-1"
          },
          "expect": {
            "namespace": "incidents",
            "tenant": "",
            "id": "inc-1",
            "embedding": {
              "model": "scripted/embed-1",
              "vector": [
                1,
                0,
                0
              ]
            },
            "content": {
              "cause": "logs"
            },
            "text": "disk full on db-1",
            "metadata": {
              "service": "db"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "recall": {
            "namespace": "incidents",
            "text": "the disk is full"
          },
          "expect": [
            {
              "id": "inc-1",
              "similarity": 0.998752
            },
            {
              "id": "inc-2",
              "similarity": 0.049938
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "calls": [
        [
          "disk full on db-1"
        ],
        [
          "pod in a crash loop"
        ],
        [
          "the disk is full"
        ]
      ],
      "events": [
        "ModelCallStarted embeddings embed-1 scripted",
        "ModelCallCompleted embeddings Succeeded 4",
        "ModelCallStarted embeddings embed-1 scripted",
        "ModelCallCompleted embeddings Succeeded 4",
        "ModelCallStarted embeddings embed-1 scripted",
        "ModelCallCompleted embeddings Succeeded 4"
      ]
    },
